        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "DEET (N,N-Diethyl-meta-toluamide) is a powerful synthetic aromatic amide that provides broad-spectrum protection but acts as a strong solvent plasticizer for synthetic polymers and plastics. Picaridin (Icaridin) is a piperidine derivative that offers equivalent vector protection without damaging synthetic apparel, plastics, or fishing gear, and has a significantly lighter skin feel."
