        "text": "p-Menthane-3,8-diol (PMD), extracted from lemon eucalyptus or synthetically produced, demonstrates protection times comparable to low-dose DEET. However, unrefined natural essential oils (citronella, lemongrass) flash off rapidly due to high vapor pressure, requiring film-forming polymers to extend protection duration beyond 1–2 hours."
      }
